{"repositoryId":1189920190,"availability":"available","full":"zensation-ai/zenbrain","name":"zenbrain","description":"Dynamic agent memory for LLM agents: 7 neuroscience-inspired layers (working, episodic, semantic, procedural) with FSRS spaced repetition and memory consolidation. Zero-dependency TypeScript library, Model Context Protocol (MCP) server, Vercel AI SDK middleware. Paper: arXiv 2604.23878 · reproduction packages on Zenodo.","category":"Education","language":"TypeScript","stars":27,"forks":7,"created":"2026-03-23T19:51:02Z","updated":"2026-10-12T08:54:47Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://zensation.ai/open-source","topics":["agent-memory","ai-memory","cognitive-architecture","ebbinghaus","episodic-memory","forgetting-curve","fsrs","hebbian-learning","llm-memory","long-term-memory","longmemeval","memory-consolidation","memory-layer","neuroscience","procedural-memory","semantic-memory","spaced-repetition","stateful-agents","working-memory","zero-dependencies"],"demo":"https://zensation.ai/en/playground?utm_source=github&utm_medium=readme&utm_campaign=evergreen","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T13:01:38.480Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-15T13:01:38.480Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-15T13:01:38.480Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-15T13:01:38.480Z","stars":27,"forks":7}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["The neuroscience-inspired memory system for AI agents.","7 memory layers and a library of 20 neuroscience-inspired algorithm modules: FSRS, Hebbian learning, sleep replay, emotional tagging, plus 10 advanced research modules (vmPFC-FSRS, two-factor Hebbian, simulation-selection sleep, Fiedler-value KG health, IB budget, Hopfield STM, ...). Pure TypeScript. Zero dependencies. 822 tests. Extracted from a production AI platform.","Status: pre-1.0, semver — the public API can still change before 1.0."],"features":["arXiv preprint (cs.AI): arxiv.org/abs/2604.23878","ORCID: 0009-0001-1793-012X","License: CC BY 4.0 (paper) · Apache-2.0 (code)"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/zensation-ai/zenbrain/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"2f37c095cdc7a48fa2c0429a78a5c2265a5135f657032a152d20b20c4325b57d","extractedAt":"2026-10-15T13:01:38.696Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T13:01:38.696Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"The neuroscience-inspired memory system for AI agents.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/zensation-ai/zenbrain/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"hosting","status":"documented","text":"Self-hosted: the library makes no network calls of its own.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/zensation-ai/zenbrain/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"Four experiment suites (95 tests), the reference JSON the paper's tables were generated from, and verify-against-reference.mjs, which diffs a fresh run against that reference and exits non-zero on drift. npm install && npm run experiments; the run itself needs no API keys and no network, and finishes in under a minute on a laptop.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/zensation-ai/zenbrain/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"2f37c095cdc7a48fa2c0429a78a5c2265a5135f657032a152d20b20c4325b57d","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/zensation-ai/zenbrain/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T13:01:38.696Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-12T08:54:47Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/zensation-ai/zenbrain/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T13:01:38.697Z","hash":"2f37c095cdc7a48fa2c0429a78a5c2265a5135f657032a152d20b20c4325b57d","originalBytes":32934,"storedBytes":32934,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T13:01:38.480Z","subjects":["MCP servers & agents"],"platforms":[],"classification":{"version":4,"method":"local_rules","category":"Education","subjects":["MCP servers & agents"],"evidence":[{"subject":"MCP servers & agents","source":"metadata","match":"agent"}],"p